n cover depreciation), so fundamental growth is near zero.","Forward indicators: a book-to-bill of 1.02, a backlog worth 6% of annual revenue and deferred revenue up 48%.","Capex runs only 0.1x depreciation (1.0% of sales), so the asset base is being harvested rather than grown.","Its Rule of 40 score is 27, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business.","Analysts expect 13.1% long-term annual earnings growth."],"own":["Insiders hold little stock (0.9%), and institutions hold 96%.","Insiders have only sold over the past year (9 sales, net $25.0M sold).","Net share issuance leaves shareholder yield negative (-1.2%), diluting holders.","The share count has grown 4.2% a year over five years, diluting existing holders.","It has paid a dividend for 37 consecutive years, raising it 13.9% a year over the last five."],"people":["With about 74,614 employees, each generates about $187K of revenue, 0.4x the Financial Services median, and productivity has risen 14.4% a year.","That works out to $24K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $11.7M (63x revenue per employee)."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":21,"head":"Avoid: the model rates it PASS.","pros":["Revenue grew 14.8%/yr over 5y"],"cons":["Model rating PASS (composite 21, gates 6/14)","Trades 35% above fair value of $209","ROE 6.4% vs cost of equity 8.0%","P/E 43.0x vs sector 12.2x","EV/EBITDA 18.5x vs sector 10.9x"],"flags":["The model rates it PASS"],"need":[],"buy_below":177.39,"vc":{"base":208.69,"base_src":"dcf","bear":135.39,"bull":326.03,"alt_median":61.8,"n_alt":3,"gap":2.3769,"dispersion":0.2636,"level":"LOW","why":["DCF is 238% above the other models' median ($61.80)"]},"med":{"pe":12.155,"ev_ebitda":10.862,"pfcf":12.9041,"pb":1.3934,"roic":0.116,"gross_margin":0.4181,"fcf_margin":0.2507,"div_yield":0.0265}},"ticker":"AJG","date":"2026-11-06"}